80
00:06:04,858 --> 00:06:07,421
three million ten thousand three hundred forty-nine

81
00:06:09,421 --> 00:06:16,517
one million eight hundred sixty thousand four hundred ninety-eight plus three million ten thousand three hundred forty-nine equals

82
00:06:16,677 --> 00:06:20,420
four million eight hundred seventy thousand eight hundred forty-seven

83
00:06:22,420 --> 00:06:29,792
three million ten thousand three hundred forty-nine plus four million eight hundred seventy thousand eight hundred forty-seven equals

84
